### Muon trident events in the LYSO setup, for pictures for slides; scripts/trident_views_lyso.sh runs it, twice for
### the searches whose events it draws. The geometry of macro/vis_lyso.mac (keep them in step): the Si/YSO stack out,
### the 4 cm Al target at z = 32.5 to 36.5 cm with the LYSO panel under it, the 10 cm lead roof and walls. The muons of
### macro/trident_cosmic.mac: sea-level cosmic mu+ and mu- above 0.85 GeV (no trident below) from the 2 x 2 m plane at
### z = 112 cm, zenith < 75 deg, tridents made 10^5 times more often (weight 1e-5). The run keeps the first {tvKept}
### events with a detectable trident (the primary after its trident and the produced mu+ and mu- all cross a bar of
### the top and of the middle TOF: /tof/tridents/keepForVis 2), printing a line "Kept trident event ..." for each,
### and then stops; only events with a trident are written, to {tvDir}/jobs/{tvFile}.root.
### With tvDraw 1 it also opens the offscreen viewer before the run (macro/vis_tridents_lyso_viewer.mac), so that the
### kept events can be drawn after it (/vis/reviewKeptEvents macro/vis_trident_event_lyso.mac, in the job macro). The
### same tvSeed gives the same events with and without the viewer.
### Aliases: tvSeed, tvKept, tvDir, tvFile, tvJob (the search's number), tvDraw (0 or 1). In the build directory:
###   ./TOFmeter --preinit macro/physics_tridents.mac <job macro: the aliases, then /control/execute this file>

/control/verbose 2
/tof/det/worldSize 420 420 300 cm
/tof/det/stack false
/tof/target/size 20 20 4 cm
/tof/target/position 0 0 34.5 cm
/control/execute macro/panel_lyso.mac
/tof/czt/position 0 0 32.332 cm
/update

/control/if {tvDraw} == 1 macro/vis_tridents_lyso_viewer.mac

/process/em/setBiasingFactor muToMuonPairProd 1e5 true
/run/physicsModified
/OutputFormat 1
/EventFilter 3
/OutputDirectory {tvDir}/jobs
/OutputFile {tvFile}
/gun/seed {tvSeed}
/GeneralParticleSource 2
/tof/cosmic/model expacs
/tof/cosmic/species mu+ mu-
/tof/cosmic/angular all 2 mu+ guan mu- guan
/tof/cosmic/planeCenter 0 0 112 cm
/tof/cosmic/halfX 100 cm
/tof/cosmic/halfY 100 cm
/tof/cosmic/thetaMax 75 deg
/tof/cosmic/energyMin 0.85 GeV
/tof/cosmic/energyMax 1000 GeV
/tof/tridents/keepForVis 2
/tof/tridents/maxKept {tvKept}
/run/printProgress 100000
# stops at the {tvKept}-th detectable trident (about 18000 muons each)
/run/beamOn 10000000
